      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:00.00",
      "end_raw": "00:04.00",
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 4000,
      "text": "Medium profile shot of Juliana slumped on the damp stone floor of her dark dungeon cell, her wrists bound in heavy iron shackles and chains draped over her lap.",
      "line_number": 14,
      "duration_ms": 4000
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP038_B002",
      "episode_id": "EP038",
      "file_index": 1,
      "scene_id": "EP038_S01",
      "block_type": "ACTION",
      "label_raw": "ACTION",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:00.00",
      "end_raw": "00:03.50",
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 3500,
      "text": "Juliana sits motionless against the cold masonry, weak and visibly drained from starvation, her eyes cast downward.",
      "line_number": 18,
      "duration_ms": 3500
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP038_B003",
      "episode_id": "EP038",
      "file_index": 2,
      "scene_id": "EP038_S01",
      "block_type": "SOUND_FX",
      "label_raw": "SOUND FX",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:03.20",
      "end_raw": "00:06.00",
      "start_ms": 3200,
      "end_ms": 6000,
      "text": "Echoing, heavy bootsteps approach down the corridor outside the cell.",
      "line_number": 22,
      "duration_ms": 2800
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP038_B004",
      "episode_id": "EP038",
      "file_index": 3,
      "scene_id": "EP038_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:04.00",
      "end_raw": "00:07.50",
      "start_ms": 4000,
      "end_ms": 7500,
      "text": "Tight close-up on Juliana's profile as her head turns toward the corridor, her blue eyes widening with cautious alarm.",
      "line_number": 26,
      "duration_ms": 3500
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP038_B005",
      "episode_id": "EP038",
      "file_index": 4,
      "scene_id": "EP038_S01",
      "block_type": "ACTION",
      "label_raw": "ACTION",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:05.00",
      "end_raw": "00:07.50",
      "start_ms": 5000,
      "end_ms": 7500,
      "text": "Juliana blinks, lifting her gaze toward the heavy iron bars.",
      "line_number": 30,
      "duration_ms": 2500
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP038_B006",
      "episode_id": "EP038",
      "file_index": 5,
      "scene_id": "EP038_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:07.50",
      "end_raw": "00:11.00",
      "start_ms": 7500,
      "end_ms": 11000,
      "text": "Medium shot through the cell bars as a Guard in a black collared uniform with silver buttons halts outside.",
      "line_number": 34,
      "duration_ms": 3500
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP038_B007",
      "episode_id": "EP038",
      "file_index": 6,
      "scene_id": "EP038_S01",
      "block_type": "ACTION",
      "label_raw": "ACTION",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:08.50",
      "end_raw": "00:11.00",
      "start_ms": 8500,
      "end_ms": 11000,
      "text": "The Guard pauses, glancing over his shoulder into the gloomy corridor to ensure he is unobserved.",
      "line_number": 38,
      "duration_ms": 2500
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP038_B008",
      "episode_id": "EP038",
      "file_index": 7,
      "scene_id": "EP038_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:11.00",
      "end_raw": "00:15.50",
      "start_ms": 11000,
      "end_ms": 15500,
      "text": "Low-angle shot focusing on the wet flagstones at the base of the cell door.",
      "line_number": 42,
      "duration_ms": 4500
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP038_B009",
      "episode_id": "EP038",
      "file_index": 8,
      "scene_id": "EP038_S01",
      "block_type": "ACTION",
      "label_raw": "ACTION",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:11.00",
      "end_raw": "00:15.50",
      "start_ms": 11000,
      "end_ms": 15500,
      "text": "The Guard kneels down and slips a small loaf of rustic bread through the bottom gap between the iron bars, nudging it inside before withdrawing his gloved hand.",
      "line_number": 46,
      "duration_ms": 4500
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP038_B010",
      "episode_id": "EP038",
      "file_index": 9,
      "scene_id": "EP038_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:15.50",
      "end_raw": "00:17.50",
      "start_ms": 15500,
      "end_ms": 17500,
      "text": "Low-angle close-up of Juliana crawling forward across the stone floor toward the bread, her gaze fixed on the offering in disbelief.",
      "line_number": 50,
      "duration_ms": 2000
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP038_B011",
      "episode_id": "EP038",
      "file_index": 10,
      "scene_id": "EP038_S01",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "JULIANA (Breathless, Bewildered)",
      "speaker": "JULIANA",
      "delivery": [
        "Breathless",
        "Bewildered"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:16.00",
      "end_raw": "00:17.30",
      "start_ms": 16000,
      "end_ms": 17300,
      "text": "\"Why?\"",
      "line_number": 54,
      "duration_ms": 1300
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP038_B012",
      "episode_id": "EP038",
      "file_index": 11,
      "scene_id": "EP038_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:17.50",
      "end_raw": "00:21.50",
      "start_ms": 17500,
      "end_ms": 21500,
      "text": "Medium close-up of the Guard looking through the vertical bars with quiet compassion.",
      "line_number": 58,
      "duration_ms": 4000
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP038_B013",
      "episode_id": "EP038",
      "file_index": 12,
      "scene_id": "EP038_S01",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "GUARD (Subdued, Sincere)",
      "speaker": "GUARD",
      "delivery": [
        "Subdued",
        "Sincere"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:17.50",
      "end_raw": "00:20.30",
      "start_ms": 17500,
      "end_ms": 20300,
      "text": "\"Because no one should die hungry.\"",
      "line_number": 62,
      "duration_ms": 2800
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP038_B014",
      "episode_id": "EP038",
      "file_index": 13,
      "scene_id": "EP038_S01",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "GUARD (Urgent, Whispered)",
      "speaker": "GUARD",
      "delivery": [
        "Urgent",
        "Whispered"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:20.50",
      "end_raw": "00:22.00",
      "start_ms": 20500,
      "end_ms": 22000,
      "text": "\"Eat it before they see.\"",
      "line_number": 66,
      "duration_ms": 1500
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP038_B015",
      "episode_id": "EP038",
      "file_index": 14,
      "scene_id": "EP038_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:21.50",
      "end_raw": "00:23.20",
      "start_ms": 21500,
      "end_ms": 23200,
      "text": "Over-the-shoulder shot through the cell bars as the Guard turns and walks swiftly away into the dark corridor.",
      "line_number": 70,
      "duration_ms": 1700
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP038_B016",
      "episode_id": "EP038",
      "file_index": 15,
      "scene_id": "EP038_S01",
      "block_type": "ACTION",
      "label_raw": "ACTION",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:21.80",
      "end_raw": "00:23.20",
      "start_ms": 21800,
      "end_ms": 23200,
      "text": "The Guard's silhouette retreats into the shadows.",
      "line_number": 74,
      "duration_ms": 1400
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP038_B017",
      "episode_id": "EP038",
      "file_index": 16,
      "scene_id": "EP038_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:23.20",
      "end_raw": "00:30.50",
      "start_ms": 23200,
      "end_ms": 30500,
      "text": "Tight shot following Juliana's trembling, shackle-bound hands as she reaches out and drags the loaf toward her chest.",
      "line_number": 78,
      "duration_ms": 7300
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP038_B018",
      "episode_id": "EP038",
      "file_index": 17,
      "scene_id": "EP038_S01",
      "block_type": "ACTION",
      "label_raw": "ACTION",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:23.50",
      "end_raw": "00:27.50",
      "start_ms": 23500,
      "end_ms": 27500,
      "text": "Juliana clutches the bread tightly with both hands, tears welling in her eyes.",
      "line_number": 82,
      "duration_ms": 4000
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP038_B019",
      "episode_id": "EP038",
      "file_index": 18,
      "scene_id": "EP038_S01",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "JULIANA (Choked Up, Tearful)",
      "speaker": "JULIANA",
      "delivery": [
        "Choked Up",
        "Tearful"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:26.00",
      "end_raw": "00:27.50",
      "start_ms": 26000,
      "end_ms": 27500,
      "text": "\"Thank you.\"",
      "line_number": 86,
      "duration_ms": 1500
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP038_B020",
      "episode_id": "EP038",
      "file_index": 19,
      "scene_id": "EP038_S01",
      "block_type": "ACTION",
      "label_raw": "ACTION",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:27.80",
      "end_raw": "00:31.00",
      "start_ms": 27800,
      "end_ms": 31000,
      "text": "Starving and overcome with emotion, Juliana presses the bread to her lips and tears off a desperate, ravenous bite.",
      "line_number": 90,
      "duration_ms": 3200
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP038_B021",
      "episode_id": "EP038",
      "file_index": 20,
      "scene_id": "EP038_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:30.50",
      "end_raw": "00:35.00",
      "start_ms": 30500,
      "end_ms": 35000,
      "text": "Close-up profile of Juliana chewing the bread, tears rolling down her soot-streaked cheek.",
      "line_number": 94,
      "duration_ms": 4500
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP038_B022",
      "episode_id": "EP038",
      "file_index": 21,
      "scene_id": "EP038_S01",
      "block_type": "ACTION",
      "label_raw": "ACTION",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:31.00",
      "end_raw": "00:34.50",
      "start_ms": 31000,
      "end_ms": 34500,
      "text": "Juliana chews hungrily, closing her eyes as the agonizing reality of her plight hits her anew.",
      "line_number": 98,
      "duration_ms": 3500
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP038_B023",
      "episode_id": "EP038",
      "file_index": 22,
      "scene_id": "EP038_S01",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "JULIANA (Sorrowful, Whispering)",
      "speaker": "JULIANA",
      "delivery": [
        "Sorrowful",
        "Whispering"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:34.50",
      "end_raw": "00:36.50",
      "start_ms": 34500,
      "end_ms": 36500,
      "text": "\"Alexander...\"",
      "line_number": 102,
      "duration_ms": 2000
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP038_B024",
      "episode_id": "EP038",
      "file_index": 23,
      "scene_id": "EP038_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:35.00",
      "end_raw": "00:39.50",
      "start_ms": 35000,
      "end_ms": 39500,
      "text": "Low-angle wide shot of Juliana seated against the damp stone wall beneath high overhead iron ceiling grates, clutching the half-eaten bread in her lap.",
      "line_number": 106,
      "duration_ms": 4500
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP038_B025",
      "episode_id": "EP038",
      "file_index": 24,
      "scene_id": "EP038_S01",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "JULIANA (Yearning)",
      "speaker": "JULIANA",
      "delivery": [
        "Yearning"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:36.80",
      "end_raw": "00:39.00",
      "start_ms": 36800,
      "end_ms": 39000,
      "text": "\"...are you safe?\"",
      "line_number": 110,
      "duration_ms": 2200
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP038_B026",
      "episode_id": "EP038",
      "file_index": 25,
      "scene_id": "EP038_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:39.50",
      "end_raw": "00:45.50",
      "start_ms": 39500,
      "end_ms": 45500,
      "text": "Intimate close-up of Juliana looking upward, her tear-stained face filled with raw anguish.",
      "line_number": 114,
      "duration_ms": 6000
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP038_B027",
      "episode_id": "EP038",
      "file_index": 26,
      "scene_id": "EP038_S01",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "JULIANA (Desperate, Trembling)",
      "speaker": "JULIANA",
      "delivery": [
        "Desperate",
        "Trembling"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:40.00",
      "end_raw": "00:43.00",
      "start_ms": 40000,
      "end_ms": 43000,
      "text": "\"Do you even know what happened to me?\"",
      "line_number": 118,
      "duration_ms": 3000
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP038_B028",
      "episode_id": "EP038",
      "file_index": 27,
      "scene_id": "EP038_S01",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "JULIANA (Grief-Stricken)",
      "speaker": "JULIANA",
      "delivery": [
        "Grief-Stricken"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:43.20",
      "end_raw": "00:45.20",
      "start_ms": 43200,
      "end_ms": 45200,
      "text": "\"Do you know they condemned me?\"",
      "line_number": 122,
      "duration_ms": 2000
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP038_B029",
      "episode_id": "EP038",
      "file_index": 28,
      "scene_id": "EP038_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:45.50",
      "end_raw": "00:51.00",
      "start_ms": 45500,
      "end_ms": 51000,
      "text": "Tight macro shot on Juliana's chin and throat as she presses a trembling hand against her chest.",
      "line_number": 126,
      "duration_ms": 5500
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP038_B030",
      "episode_id": "EP038",
      "file_index": 29,
      "scene_id": "EP038_S01",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "JULIANA (Fearful, Pleading)",
      "speaker": "JULIANA",
      "delivery": [
        "Fearful",
        "Pleading"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:45.50",
      "end_raw": "00:47.50",
      "start_ms": 45500,
      "end_ms": 47500,
      "text": "\"What if I die here?\"",
      "line_number": 130,
      "duration_ms": 2000
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP038_B031",
      "episode_id": "EP038",
      "file_index": 30,
      "scene_id": "EP038_S01",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
      "label_raw": "JULIANA (Heartbroken)",
      "speaker": "JULIANA",
      "delivery": [
        "Heartbroken"
      ],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:47.80",
      "end_raw": "00:50.50",
      "start_ms": 47800,
      "end_ms": 50500,
      "text": "\"What if I never see you again?\"",
      "line_number": 134,
      "duration_ms": 2700
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP038_B032",
      "episode_id": "EP038",
      "file_index": 31,
      "scene_id": "EP038_S01",
      "block_type": "ACTION",
      "label_raw": "ACTION",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:48.50",
      "end_raw": "00:51.00",
      "start_ms": 48500,
      "end_ms": 51000,
      "text": "A heavy tear drips down from her jaw, falling into the dark dampness below.",
      "line_number": 138,
      "duration_ms": 2500
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP038_B033",
      "episode_id": "EP038",
      "file_index": 32,
      "scene_id": "EP038_S01",
      "block_type": "CAMERA",
      "label_raw": "CAMERA",
      "speaker": null,
      "delivery": [],
      "offscreen": null,
      "start_raw": "00:51.00",
      "end_raw": "00:55.50",
      "start_ms": 51000,
      "end_ms": 55500,
      "text": "Medium close-up profile of Juliana closing her eyes, drawing a deep breath to steady herself.",
      "line_number": 142,
      "duration_ms": 4500
    },
    {
      "block_id": "EP038_B034",
      "episode_id": "EP038",
      "file_index": 33,
      "scene_id": "EP038_S01",
      "block_type": "DIALOGUE",
